{
  "id": "PSA.44",
  "number": "44",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 44",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "44",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "*Au chef de musique. Des fils de Coré. Instruction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.44.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.44.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! nous avons entendu de nos oreilles, nos pères nous ont raconté l'œuvre que tu as opérée dans leurs jours, aux jours d'autrefois.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as, par ta main, dépossédé les nations, et tu as planté nos pères",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; tu as affligé les peuples et tu les as chassés",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car ce n'est point par leur épée qu'ils ont possédé le pays, et ce n'est pas leur bras qui les a sauvés ; car c'est ta droite et ton bras et la lumière de ta face, parce que tu avais pris ton plaisir en eux.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "C'est toi qui es mon roi, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.44.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.44.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! Commande le salut pour Jacob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avec toi, nous frapperons nos adversaires ; par ton nom, nous foulerons ceux qui s'élèvent contre nous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car ce n'est pas en mon arc que je me confie, et mon épée ne me sauvera point ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car tu nous as sauvés de nos adversaires, et tu rends confus ceux qui nous haïssent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.44.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.44.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nous nous glorifierons",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "tout le jour, et nous célébrerons ton nom à toujours. Sélah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mais tu nous as rejetés et rendus confus, et tu ne sors plus avec nos armées ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu nous as fait retourner en arrière devant l'adversaire, et ceux qui nous haïssent ont pillé pour eux-mêmes ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu nous as livrés comme des brebis [destinées] à être mangées, et tu nous as dispersés parmi les nations ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as vendu ton peuple pour rien, et tu ne t'es pas agrandi par leur prix",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ";",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu nous as mis en opprobre chez nos voisins, en risée et en raillerie auprès de nos alentours ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu nous as mis comme proverbe parmi les nations, comme hochement de tête parmi les peuples.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tout le jour ma confusion est devant moi, et la honte de ma face m'a couvert,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "À cause de la voix de celui qui outrage et qui injurie, à cause de l'ennemi et du vengeur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tout cela nous est arrivé, et nous ne t'avons pas oublié, et nous n'avons pas été infidèles à ton alliance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Notre cœur ne s'est pas retiré en arrière, et nos pas n'ont point dévié de ton sentier ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Quoique tu nous aies écrasés dans le lieu des chacals, et que tu nous aies couverts de l'ombre de la mort.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si nous avions oublié le nom de notre",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.44.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.44.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", et étendu nos mains vers un ✶dieu étranger,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.44.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.44.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne s'en enquerrait-il pas ? car lui connaît les secrets du cœur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mais, à cause de toi, nous sommes mis à mort tous les jours, nous sommes estimés comme des brebis de tuerie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Éveille-toi ! Pourquoi dors-tu, Seigneur ? Réveille-toi ; ne nous rejette pas pour toujours.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pourquoi caches-tu ta face, [et] oublies-tu notre affliction et notre oppression ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.44.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
